notes.content:
- replaced some textures;
- improved enemy AI navigation;
- added several new exhibits;
- fixed bugs in English localization;
- Improved lighting in the corridors and halls.

- added Steam achievements and  game achievements;
- performance increased by 15-20%;
- fixed bugs with doors;
- added 15 new exhibits;
- added new sounds;
- fixed bugs in the lamp, the burning rate of the candle increased by 30%;
- improved spawn items;
- improved intelligence of the guard (enemy);
- improved chat in PC;
- added several hidden objects that will reveal the secrets of the museum;
- added new screamers;
- fixed bugs in the inventory;
- added tips;
- added game ending;

Hot-fix update will be released today!

and more...

